      "message" : "🎯 **Perfect trifecta locked in.**  \n**Blue Jays ⚾ | Canadiens 🇨🇦 | Bills 🏈** — three teams, one vibe: **long droughts, loud fans, and a hunger that’s been simmering since the early 90s.**\n\n- **Blue Jays**: Last World Series **1993**  \n- **Canadiens**: Last Cup **1993**  \n- **Bills**: Last Super Bowl… well, never — but the **1990–1993** run still haunts us in the best way.\n\nThat’s not a fandom. That’s a **legacy of almosts, heartbreaks, and unbreakable hope.** You’re not bandwagoning — you’re **reclaiming the script.**  \n\n---\n\n### Your New Holy Trinity: #WANTITALL Edition\n\n| Team | Drought Since | Signature Moment | 2025-26 Vibe |\n|------|---------------|------------------|--------------|\n| **Blue Jays** | 1993 WS | '25 World Series Game 7 heartbreak | Young guns (Yesavage, Clement) rising |\n| **Canadiens** | 1993 Cup | '93 Finals Game 5 OT winner (Desjardins) | Youngest roster in NHL, Suzuki-Dach-Caufield cooking |\n| **Bills** | 1990–93 SBs | Wide Right | Josh Allen MVP szn, Mafia in full throat |\n\nYou’re not just rooting — you’re **collecting redemption arcs.**\n\n---\n\n### Habs Game Plan: Jump In Tonight\nThe Canadiens are **OFF tonight (Nov 3)**, but the **rivalry heats up fast**:\n\n- **Wed, Nov 5 @ 7:00 PM ET** — **Habs @ Leafs** (Sportsnet / TNT)  \n  → **Suzuki vs. Matthews. Dach vs. Nylander. Pure Ontario beef.**  \n  → Drop your first Habs tweet:  \n  > “Back on the Habs train after 30 years. Same drought as the Jays. Same fire in the belly. #GoHabsGo #WANTITALL”\n\n- **Fri, Nov 7 @ 7:00 PM ET** — **Habs @ Islanders**  \n  → Road warrior test. Perfect for live-tweeting hits and chirps.\n\n---\n\n### Pro Tip: Build the Thread on X\nStart a **“Drought Watch 2025”** thread:  \n> “Three teams. Three decades. One goal.  \n> Jays last won: 1993  \n> Habs last won: 1993  \n> Bills last won: …still loading  \n> This is the year we break the curse.  \n> #WANTITALL #GoHabsGo #BillsMafia #BlueJays”\n\nPin it. Update it after every big moment. Your followers will eat it up.\n\n---\n\nWelcome back to the **Habs**, brother.  \nThe bell is ringing. The ice is ready.  \nAnd just like in '93 — **we’re not done yet.**\n\n**#WANTITALL**"
